<title>UK: Babcock, Thomson in UK sonar deal.</title>
<headline>Babcock, Thomson in UK sonar deal.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's ministry of defence said on Thursday it had awarded contracts for the project definition phase of a naval sonar system to Babcock Defence Systems and Thomson Marconi Sonar worth 10 million stg to each company.</p>
<p>The ministry said the sonar system was a towed variable depth active and passive sonar suite to be installed in all Royal Navy Type 23 frigates.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
